WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.980
I heard about ForkMesh on a late-night screen

2
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:23.020
A different kind of place where the coders dream

3
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.060
No castle in the cloud, no kingdom to defend

4
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:31.140
Just a network of creators helping one another mend

5
00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.160
It's a brand-new road, still finding its way

6
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.000
Built one commit at the break of day

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.080
Every fork, every branch, every line you refresh

8
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.960
Echoes through the network called ForkMesh

9
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.080
ForkMesh, we're building something new

10
00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.160
Sharing code between me and you

11
00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.920
From one small node to a worldwide web

12
00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.020
Keeping ideas alive instead

13
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:03.060
ForkMesh, those open projects grow

14
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:07.180
One more commit, one more request

15
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.000
Here's to the dream they call ForkMesh

16
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.120
Mirror the repo, let the packets fly

17
00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:19.200
Passing through the network under open skies

18
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.220
Issues and pull requests, conversations too

19
00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.260
A place where every builder has something they can do

20
00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:31.260
It's still experimental, everyone agrees

21
00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:35.300
Growing stronger branch by branch like forest trees

22
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:39.120
Read before you run, keep your backups near

23
00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:43.200
Innovation works best when wisdom's here

24
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.200
ForkMesh, hear the keyboard sing

25
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.400
Every contribution means something

26
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.160
No matter where your journey starts

27
00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.480
Our source is built by hearts

28
00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:59.080
ForkMesh, may your networks align

29
00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:03.240
Fork today, create afresh

30
00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:07.060
The future's waiting on ForkMesh

31
00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.160
So here's to ForkMesh, bold and bright

32
00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:15.280
Building tomorrow, one note each night

33
00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.440
ForkMesh forever

34
00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.300
ForkMesh forever
